1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,090
DeepJEB: generate shapes, predict their response, then select a design.

2
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:16,160
Use the + button to zoom in on the pipeline.

3
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:28,560
Click SDFFlow to inspect the shape-generation model.

4
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:46,300
Click HI-MGN: this model predicts the structural response.

5
00:00:46,300 --> 00:01:02,660
Open the generated candidates and click one bracket.

6
00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:13,890
Click Mesh, then drag the bracket to inspect its shape.

7
00:01:13,890 --> 00:01:30,060
Click Field and von_mises to inspect the predicted stress.

8
00:01:30,060 --> 00:01:43,690
Click u_z to show predicted vertical displacement on the same shape.

9
00:01:43,690 --> 00:01:53,440
Close the viewer and open Optimization from the pipeline.

10
00:01:53,440 --> 00:02:14,410
Select vertical deflection as a second objective. Apply a 0.4 mm limit.

11
00:02:14,410 --> 00:02:24,190
Scroll to the Pareto plot. Each point is a generated design.

12
00:02:24,190 --> 00:02:39,410
Click a Pareto point to reopen that design and inspect it in 3D.
